 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $-2\\le y\\le 0.$\n\nTherefore, the ranges are $2\\le x\\le 4$ and $-2\\le y\\le 0.$" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262738 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262739 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262740 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262741 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262742 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1041 "selection" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1104 #edb/ref 17592186262741 13194139533873 true] [17592186262737 1110 #uuid "0b5d3436-22c7-5198-9784-1b23b171f2e7" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262738 1034 "-3\\le x\\le 3,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262738 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533873 true] [17592186262738 1111 #uuid "d9b98c5f-8469-566f-9ea2-4426632978e3" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262739 1034 "-3\\le x\\le 3,\\,-2\\le y\\le 0" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262739 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533873 true] [17592186262739 1111 #uuid "6278b842-ccbf-525b-bc19-04550f2f051b" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262740 1034 "-4\\le x\\le -2,\\,0\\le y\\le 2" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262740 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533873 true] [17592186262740 1111 #uuid "f1228a3e-4e83-5713-85fb-13a21482535a" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262741 1034 "2\\le x\\le 4,\\,-2\\le y\\le 0" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262741 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533873 true] [17592186262741 1111 #uuid "d3da6420-8e20-5e63-ac4f-2a3a6caeb3e0" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262742 1034 "2\\le x\\le 4,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262742 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533873 true] [17592186262742 1111 #uuid "895d47db-90cc-5be0-a671-2fdb140d464f" 13194139533873 true] [17592186262743 1017 #edb/ref 17592186262744 13194139533873 true] [17592186262743 1089 "q-16